msgid "One reply, written once, goes to every open feedback conversation linked to this idea, as you, on each conversation’s own channel."
msgstr "一条回复只需写一次，就会以你的名义，通过每个对话各自的渠道，发送给关联到此想法的每个未关闭的反馈对话。"

